Subject: [PATCH 4/4] F-1/F-11 v0.10 (Reviewer 1 round 3, items 1-5): reject
 i2cp.leaseSetPrivKey (no legacy mode); require per-client auth (DH) on remote
 LS2; F-11 immediate nullptr reply + session-destination only;
 RemoveKeyRingKey evicts LeaseSet cache (ident+store hash) and terminates peer
 sessions

